sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as data-rights settings screen
    participant Fn as requestMyDataDeletion({mode:"range", startAt, endAt, includePeer, includeAi})
    participant Edge as Edge Function delete-my-data (JWT-protected)
    participant Storage as Storage buckets
    participant DB as content tables (peer_messages, chat history, etc. for caller only)

    User->>UI: choose a date range + content types, confirm
    UI->>Fn: requestMyDataDeletion(mode="range")
    Fn->>Edge: functions.invoke("delete-my-data", body)
    Edge->>Edge: identify caller from verified JWT only — never a target user id in the request
    Edge->>Storage: delete matching Storage objects FIRST
    Edge->>DB: delete matching rows within range for caller
    Edge-->>Fn: { deleted_objects, deleted_rows, account_deleted:false }
    Fn-->>UI: confirmation summary
